        <p class="mb-0">Users who refuse cookies assume all responsibility for any resulting loss of functionality.
E-Date use of cookies is basically related to the performance of E-Date’s site, such as analytics that help us determine how our site is performing and ensuring a smooth and trouble free experience for our members and visitors.
Our use of cookies and local storage devices, including the specific cookie names, may change over time, but will generally fall into the above categories. We will notify you of any important changes to our use of cookies and local storage devices. Please visit this page regularly so that you are aware of any changes. Everything stories in the cookies improves your experience.
</p>
          <h3>What do we store in the Cookies?</h3>
          <ol>
              <li>We use cookies to verify your account and determine when you're logged in so we can make it easier for you to access the E-Date and show you the appropriate experience and features.</li>
              <li>We use cookies to help us show ads and to make recommendations for your dating partner and other organisations to people who may be interested in the products, services or causes they promote.</li>
              <li>We use cookies to provide you with the best experience possible by storing your TM unique id, name, age and image.</li>
          </ol>
          <h3>What are Cookies?</h3>
          <p>
         They are small data files that are transferred to your computer/mobile’s memory and are basically a tool that stores information about your visit recognises you and your preferences each time you come on E-Date, and ensures site functionality and enables us to provide the services our members request.</p>
